//! An enumeration read as a description [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]:
//! two nullary constructors and no operation, the smallest description the
//! route reads.
//!
//! - cites: [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]
//!
//! [Chapman-2010-gentle_art_levitation]: https://doi.org/10.1145/1863543.1863547 "Chapman, Dagand, McBride and Morris, The Gentle Art of Levitation"

/// One bit: off or on.
data Bit : Type where
  | Off : Bit
  | On : Bit
